(Following technical field review, the Solar Estimator calculation model was audited and calibrated to eliminate hyper-inflated estimates for) Tj
T* (residential and commercial off-grid installations in Nigeria.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Prior sizing calculated appliances assuming flat 24-hour continuous wattage without duty cycle adjustment, and defaulted to low system) Tj
T* (voltage \(12V/24V\). For a standard home profile \(2 Fans, 1 Fridge, 20 Lights, 1HP Inverter AC on 24h backup\), the previous system) Tj
T* (yielded an impractical 34.5 kWh/day, 2646 Ah battery bank, and N10.2M estimate. The calibrated model accurately reflects real-world) Tj
T* (thermal cycling, 48V architecture, and prevailing 2026 Nigerian turnkey commercial pricing.) Tj
